plan = "When an ally is hit, a dex check; passing, it becomes the target. -25% damage a rank taking a hit that wasn't aimed at it, no rank cap (past 100% it still blocks only 100%). Rank 5+: +25% x rank to Defense taking hits for allies. Needs Reactions; who it covers and how often wait on ?13."
